Package: ooattest
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: TPM ATTESTATION
 Attests system state and measured boot hashes using TPM2 hardware security chips.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 PCR measurement verification, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
